<title>USA: Ashland to spin off Ashland Exploration unit.</title>
<headline>Ashland to spin off Ashland Exploration unit.</headline>
<dateline>ASHLAND, Ky. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ashland Inc said it will spin off less than 20 percent its Ashland Exploration Inc unit in an initial public offering during either the late spring or summer.</p>
<p>A tax-free spinoff of the company's remaining interest in the unit would likely follow the IPO, Ashland said.</p>
<p>The unit had total proven reserves of 577 billion cubic feet of natural gas and 21.5 million barrels of crude oil at September 30, Ashland said, adding that the move is still pending regulatory approvals.  Ashland did not assign a value to the unit.  Officials were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
